      "end": 7.82
    },
    {
      "text": "Oh, by the way, before we continue, my name is Kenny.",
      "start": 8.28,
      "end": 10.22
    },
    {
      "text": "I realize that you've been talking to this anonymous stranger and you don't even know my name.",
